PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. PROBLEM IDENTIFICATION

Many people find it difficult to follow a fitness plan that matches their personal goals, fitness level and daily routine. General workout plans may not be suitable for everyone.

2. PROPOSED IDEA

AI Fitness Plan is a personalized fitness planning system that uses Artificial Intelligence concepts to provide suitable fitness recommendations based on the user's requirements and goals.

3. OBJECTIVES

• To provide personalized fitness recommendations.
• To create goal-oriented workout plans.
• To make fitness planning simple and easy to understand.
• To demonstrate the application of Artificial Intelligence in fitness planning.

4. TARGET USERS

• Beginners
• Students
• Fitness enthusiasts
• People looking for a structured fitness routine

5. KEY FEATURES

• Personalized fitness planning
• Goal-based recommendations
• Workout suggestions
• Simple user input
• Easy-to-follow fitness plan

6. EXPECTED BENEFITS

The system helps users organize their fitness activities according to their individual requirements and goals.

7. TOOLS USED

• Microsoft PowerPoint – Presentation preparation
• GitHub – Project file and documentation management
• Artificial Intelligence – Personalized fitness recommendation concept

8. EXPECTED OUTCOME

The project aims to provide a simple and personalized fitness plan that helps users understand and organize their workout routine.
